  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice brown onion (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-a00d7400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place sweet potato, cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle generously with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Remove veggies from oven and set aside to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-f0590f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a pinch of salt.\n• Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-78acf920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain couscous and return to saucepan with stock concentrate and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir to combine",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-135ec630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, roasted veggies, couscous and basil pesto.\n• Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add the salad and roasted veggies to the couscous saucepan and toss everything together to save on washing up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-6cdf4c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide cauliflower and pearl couscous between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds and drizzle over dill & parsley mayonnaise to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683958d8f7d5496ac4a6f32e/step-a4a54c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
